walking paths, creating a peaceful, countryside atmosphere.\" width=\"1920\" height=\"350\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Alfursan/partners/hotel-partners/Choice-Hotel-banner-1920x350.ashx?h=350&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=0a8efdad7ef8424bba493397b405296d&amp;hash=963EBE76BCFE2B46B22F8A4A6174552D\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"d82af6fe-40cc-4d42-9d6f-dacfff1cd746\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"swiper-slide__content\"><!----><!----><h1 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Choice Privileges</span><!----></h1><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class=\"custom-pagination ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div id=\"cpage_banner\" class=\"custom-pages\"></div></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<div class=\"container main-content details-page\">\n  <div class=\"col-12 field-section1\">\n    <h2 class=\"fs-1-5 vg-0--top\">About the partner</h2>\n    <p>Fly to your favorite destination and indulge in a unique stay with our partner, Choice Hotels, offering more than 7,500 hotels to choose from worldwide. Whether you’re seeking high-end luxury or budget-friendly options, there are accommodations to match every lifestyle.</p>\n    <p>As a Choice Privileges member, you earn points on every stay and enjoy exclusive rewards and exceptional experiences. Now, you can maximize your points by redeeming them for AlFursan Reward Miles, turning your dream vacation into reality anywhere in the world.</p>\n\n    <a href=\"https://www.choicehotels.com/en-uk?utm_source=saudia.com-partnerpage&amp;utm_campaign=saudia.com\" class=\"saudia-btn saudia-btn--primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Book now</a>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">Miles earned</h3>\n    <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n      <li>Earn 1,000 AlFursan Reward Miles for every 5,000 converted Choice Privileges points.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">How to earn Miles</h3>\n    <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n      <li>Visit the Choice Hotels <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.choicehotels.com/en-uk/choice-privileges/rewards-exchange?utm_source=saudia.com-partnerpage&amp;utm_campaign=saudia.com\" target=\"_blank\">Rewards Exchange page</a>.</li>\n      <li>Log in to your Choice Privileges account or join the loyalty program for free.</li>\n      <li>Link your Choice Privileges account to your AlFursan account.</li>\n      <li>Start the Miles redemption process.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">Terms and conditions</h3>\n    <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n      <li>Specific terms and conditions for the Choice Privileges Loyalty Program apply.</li>\n      <li>AlFursan program terms and conditions apply.</li>\n      <li>For inquiries about missing Miles, please visit the <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.choicehotels.com/en-uk/support\" target=\"_blank\">Choice Hotels support page</a>.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}